Short:    Userlister for ABBS misc menu V1.2.
Author:   kaim@powertech.no (Kai Michelsen)
Uploader: kaim@powertech.no (Kai Michelsen)
Type:     comm/bbs


Userlister v1.2 © 1994 Kai Michelsen, 1995 Quadra Productions.

Userlister will scan your userfile and print out your users with
some info about each user. The info you will get is: files uploaded,
files downloaded, kb uploaded, kb downloaded, number og messages written
and how many times the user has been online at your board. Userlister
will also display RIP behind the username if the user is killed by sysop.

News in this version:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

* Number of messages written
* Userlister is now compiled with RexxPlus
  (you must have rpstart in your startup-sequence)
